.dsh-drop/

# Dev-only generated reports, render screenshots and reference rips under tools/
# (the .cjs and .html palette tools are kept; tools/awmaps holds copyrighted
# Advance Wars map rips used only as a local style reference)
tools/**/*.png
tools/**/*.txt
# Screenshots saved for the vision model (tools/vision_input/read|unread). PNG is
# already covered above, but browser captures land as .jpg and would otherwise be
# committed the moment someone ran `git add .`.
tools/**/*.jpg
tools/**/*.jpeg
tools/**/*.webp
